               <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFDataStructure.TypedString"/>
               <body>TypedString combines a type with content defined as a simple string. May be used wherever a simple string needs to support a type definition to clarify its content.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>TypedString</name>
