                  <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFDataStructure.DefinedTerm"/>
                  <body>schema:DefinedTerm - a term from a controlled vocabulary (DefinedTermSet). Used as a typed concept reference (e.g., cdi:hasIntendedDataType / cdif:recommendedDataType point at an xsd-datatype DefinedTerm), and as one branch of CdifConceptOrTerm.</body>
